@startuml
' Traceability:
' - resilient-application-mcp requirements: R15-R18, R24-R28
title Private Selected-Text Review

skinparam backgroundColor #FFF8EA
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #167766
  LifeLineBorderColor #DFD4BD
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFDF7
  ParticipantBorderColor #123F37
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECFEF4
  ParticipantFontColor #17130F
  BoxBorderColor #DFD4BD
  BoxBackgroundColor #FFFDF7
}
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Candidate" as Candidate
box "Candidate laptop" #FFFDF7
participant "Local AI agent" as Agent
database "Local workspace\nCV, evidence, job, drafts" as Local
end box
participant "MCP checker\nserver" as Checker

Candidate -> Agent: Ask for an application package or writing review
Agent -> Local: Read verified local sources and draft locally
Agent --> Candidate: Show draft, evidence gaps, and next review action
Candidate -> Agent: Approve a selected passage for review
Agent -> Checker: Send selected text + writing mode
Checker -> Checker: Apply private safety and quality checks
Checker --> Agent: Return issue categories, risk, and revision guidance
Agent -> Local: Revise locally; record the review loop

alt CV
  Agent --> Candidate: Present one required CV review
else Cover letter
  loop Three distinct local review/revision loops
    Agent --> Candidate: Show current draft and what changed
  end
  Agent --> Candidate: Release only when local SOP verifies current evidence
else Other writing
  Agent --> Candidate: Return local revision with clear limitations
end

legend right
Full workspace remains local: CV, notes, job files, drafts, PDFs, photos, and signatures.
Only selected text is submitted. The server returns feedback, never its private checker logic.
endlegend

@enduml
